parameters.description:
**Page number, starting at 1.** Optional; by default the page the URL's own offset (`/p/` or `?fi=`) points to
(offset ÷ `page_size`, rounded down, + 1), else `1`. Paging reaches ~10,000 rows per search, as on `/search-products`;
a later page is a 400 naming the last one.

